        "sourcePath": "documentation/AppKit/nsfontmanager/addfonttrait.md",
        "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
        "ko": "기본적으로 action 메시지는 [`changeFont:`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ObjectiveC/NSObject-swift.class/changeFont:)입니다."
